<amll:meta key="appleMusicId" value="1443364632"/></metadata></head><body dur="3:33.560"><div begin="19.136" end="33.109" itunes:songPart="Verse"><p begin="19.136" end="22.409" itunes:key="L1" ttm:agent="v1"><span begin="19.136" end="19.936">如果需</span><span begin="19.936" end="20.408">要</span><span begin="20.408" end="21.085">耗光最</span><span begin="21.085" end="21.440">后</span><span begin="21.440" end="21.747">积</span><span begin="21.747" end="22.409">蓄</span></p><p begin="22.872" end="27.077" itunes:key="L2" ttm:agent="v1"><span begin="22.872" end="23.658">才可得</span><span begin="23.658" end="24.100">到</span> <span begin="24.100" end="24.776">你的半</span><span begin="24.776" end="25.218">张</span><span begin="25.218" end="25.947">感动</span><span begin="26.182" end="26.585">眉</span><span begin="26.585" end="27.077">目</span></p><p begin="28.051" end="33.109" itunes:key="L3" ttm:agent="v1"><span begin="28.051" end="28.331">挨</span><span begin="28.331" end="28.552">多</span><span begin="28.552" end="29.025">少</span><span begin="29.025" end="29.252">的</span><span begin="29.252" end="29.919">苦</span> <span begin="29.919" end="30.493">我</span><span begin="30.493" end="31.197">都</span><span begin="31.613" end="32.018">不</span><span begin="32.018" end="32.415">会</span><span begin="32.415" end="33.109">哭</span></p></div><div begin="34.341" end="47.654" itunes:songPart="Verse"><p begin="34.341" end="40.603" itunes:key="L4" ttm:agent="v1"><span begin="34.341" end="35.154">这个世</span><span begin="35.154" end="35.617">界</span><span begin="35.617" end="35.942">里</span><span begin="35.942" end="36.556">我</span><span begin="36.556" end="37.189">太渺</span><span begin="37.189" end="37.817">小</span> <span begin="37.817" end="39.358">生命在</span><span begin="39.358" end="39.708">融</span><span begin="39.708" end="40.603">掉</span></p><p begin="41.415" end="44.417" itunes:key="L5" ttm:agent="v1"><span begin="41.415" end="42.620">无心看战乱</span><span begin="42.620" end="42.983">有</span><span begin="42.